# refine-key
MARKER_STATE=off
NEEDS=chain
IFS= read -r -d '' PROMPT <<'PROMPT_EOF' || true
Use the spike-board:spike-refine skill. Refine {{NEXT_KEY}}.
PROMPT_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST <<'MUST_EOF' || true
{{NEXT_KEY}}.*refinement audit
\| Section \| Verdict \| Change \| Why \|
\| Goal \|
\| Time-box \|
(Nothing needs changing — this ticket meets the standard\.|Apply these changes\? Yes, or name a row to discuss\.)
MUST_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST_NOT <<'MUST_NOT_EOF' || true
[Oo]perator marker
Which ticket are we refining
Isaiah|Austin|Andrew
⟨|⟩
[Mm]entee machine|[Oo]perator machine|write gate
^```
MUST_NOT_EOF
